### Register User
POST https://thegt.my.id/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "dev@gmail.com",
  "password": "passdev123",
  "password_confirmation": "passdev123",
  "age": 30,
  "weight": 70.5,
  "height": 175.3,
  "gender": "male"
}

###

### Login User
POST https://thegt.my.id/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dev@gmail.com",
  "password": "passdev123"
}

###

### Get User Profile (Authenticated)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer 6|8cVPaIpqsWkDmFPryOhOS1dRkBlrONpCLDKLShjTb160dcf5
Accept: application/json

###

### Update User Profile (Authenticated)
PUT http://your-api-domain.com/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer 1|IAeAA9cExFLvtttQcvRpUy0hLBEod7By57yEOQwR309ce4d9
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Updated",
  "age": 31
}

###

### Logout User (Authenticated)
POST http://your-api-domain.com/logout
Authorization: Bearer 1|IAeAA9cExFLvtttQcvRpUy0hLBEod7By57yEOQwR309ce4d9

###

### Get Sensor Data List 
GET https://thegt.my.id/api/sensor-data

###

### Store Sensor Data 
POST https://thegt.my.id/api/sensor-data
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "left_weight": 17.34,
  "right_weight": 17.67,
  "left_mpu": 1.2345,
  "right_mpu": 1.5678,
  "piezo1": 3050,
  "piezo2": 2800,
  "piezo3": 1500,
  "piezo4": 1200,
  "piezo5": 900
}

###

### Get Risk Assessment for Patient (Authenticated)
GET https://thegt.my.id/api/sensor-data/1/risk
Authorization: Bearer 1|IAeAA9cExFLvtttQcvRpUy0hLBEod7By57yEOQwR309ce4d9

###

### Calculate OA Risk (Authenticated)
POST http://your-api-domain.com/oa-risk
Authorization: Bearer 1|IAeAA9cExFLvtttQcvRpUy0hLBEod7By57yEOQwR309ce4d9
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patient_id": 1,
  "some_other_param": "value"
}